---
// src/pages/offline.astro — Halaman offline PWA (standalone)
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id" data-theme="dark">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <title>Offline - BeebaneLabs</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=27.12">
  <style>
    :root {
      --accent-primary: #ffeb00;
      --accent-cyan: #00e5ff;
      --bg-primary: #08090a;
      --bg-secondary: #0d0e10;
      --bg-elevated: #141618;
      --text-primary: #f7f8f8;
      --text-muted: #a1a7b2;
      --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }
    html[data-theme="light"] {
      --bg-primary: #ffffff;
      --bg-secondary: #f1f3f5;
      --bg-elevated: #ffffff;
      --text-primary: #0f0f0f;
      --text-muted: #6b7280;
      --border: rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
    }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      background: var(--bg-primary);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .offline-container { max-width: 480px; }
    .offline-icon { font-size: 5rem; margin-bottom: 24px; opacity: 0.7; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    p { color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 1rem; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffeb00, #00e5ff);
      color: #0f0f0f;
    }
    .btn-secondary {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      margin-left: 12px;
    }
    html[data-theme="light"] .btn-secondary {
      background: var(--bg-secondary);
    }
    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255,235,0,0.2); }
    .cached-info {
      margin-top: 32px;
      padding: 16px;
      background: var(--bg-elevated);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }
    .cached-info strong { color: var(--text-primary); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="offline-container">
    <div class="offline-icon">📡</div>
    <h1>Tidak Ada Koneksi Internet</h1>
    <p>Sepertinya kamu sedang offline. Beberapa halaman yang sudah di-cache mungkin masih bisa diakses. Coba muat ulang halaman saat koneksi sudah pulih.</p>
    <div>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="location.reload()">🔄 Coba Lagi</button>
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary">🏠 Beranda</a>
    </div>
    <div class="cached-info">
      <strong>Tips:</strong> Halaman yang pernah kamu kunjungi tersimpan di cache dan bisa diakses offline. Artikel tutorial juga tersedia tanpa internet setelah pertama kali dibuka.
    </div>
  </div>
  <script is:inline src="/js/app.js?v=19.3"></script>
</body>
</html>
